A few important points and practical steps:

1) Check what the recipient actually needs
- If the form or organization only asks for the "last 4" then send only the last four digits.
- If they require the full SSN, ask whether they have a secure upload portal or if they accept an encrypted file / mailed copy / in-person delivery.

2) How to redact safely (do this before sending a scan)
- Replace the first five digits with Xs or block them completely (example: XXX-XX-1234). Do not rely on visual covering (white-out) that leaves underlying text recoverable.
