- Never put the full SSN in an unencrypted email body.

How to redact safely
- Physical paper:
  1. Use an opaque black marker to black out the digits you want to hide (make sure ink fully blocks the text).
  2. Photocopy or scan the redacted page and send the copy. Do not send the original unredacted scan.
  3. Keep the redacted copy as your record; dispose of any intermediate copies securely.

- Digital PDF (best options):
  - Best: Use a proper PDF redaction tool (e.g., Adobe Acrobat Pro: Tools → Redact → Mark for Redaction → Apply). This removes underlying text and metadata.
