  - Avoid naive methods like putting a black shape in a word processor and saving — some methods keep the original text underneath.
  - Remove metadata (Properties) if possible.

- Scanned image (phones/tablets):
  - Use the device’s markup to black out then save/export as a new image or PDF and confirm the text is gone (try selecting/searching — nothing should be selectable).
