- Preferred: upload through the recipient’s secure portal or document portal (most banks, HR, government agencies provide one).
- If you must email a file:
  - Password-protect the PDF (use AES-256 if available) or place it inside a password-protected ZIP.
  - Send the password via a different channel (phone call or SMS).
  - Alternatively, use an encrypted file transfer service (SFTP, secure file transfer provided by employer).
- Never send the password in the same email as the attachment.

Other things to redact or consider
- Also consider redacting other sensitive identifiers not needed by the recipient (date of birth, account numbers, driver's license) if not required.
- Keep a record of what you sent and to whom. Delete any unneeded copies and clear temporary files.

