- Use the recipient’s secure upload portal whenever available (this is the safest).
- If you must email: send a password‑protected PDF or ZIP, and transmit the password via a separate channel (phone call or SMS). Consider using end-to-end encrypted email (S/MIME, PGP) if available.
- Never send SSNs over unencrypted chat apps or public cloud links without protection.

