- Mobile apps: don’t rely on simple “markup” tools that only overlay a shape; use apps that explicitly support secure redaction or save to flattened PDF.

Secure transmission options
- Upload via the organization’s secure portal (preferred).
- Encrypted email (S/MIME or PGP) or send a password-protected PDF (use a strong password) and share the password via a different channel (phone call or SMS).
- Enterprise file transfer (SharePoint/OneDrive with restricted link) or an encrypted file-share service.
- Avoid sending full SSNs over plain email or public/cloud links without access controls.

