  - Other PDF editors often have a “redact” or “blackout” feature—use that, not just a black box drawing tool.
- If you don’t have a redaction tool:
  - Convert the page to an image and edit it in an image editor to permanently erase the SSN area, then save that image as a PDF. Or
  - Print the document, permanently black out the unwanted digits with a thick permanent marker (ensure ink soaks through), then scan the redacted paper. (Important: simply covering text with white boxes in a PDF or using a shape over text is often reversible—use true redaction or re-scan.)
