- Limit other personally identifying information on the same scan (DOB, addresses) unless required.
- Watermark the document “Confidential” if desired.
- Keep a copy of what you sent and when, in case you need to request deletion or prove what was shared.

6) If you already sent the unredacted SSN insecurely
- Contact the recipient and ask them to securely delete the file and confirm deletion.
